{"parse": {"title": "小狗与流浪汉-02", "pageid": 89609, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E6%B1%89-01\" title=\"小狗与流浪汉-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">小狗与流浪汉-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E6%B1%89-03\" title=\"小狗与流浪汉-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">小狗与流浪汉</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.A2.A0.E6.89.91.E8.8B.B9.E6.9E.9C.E6.B4.BE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"颠扑苹果派\">颠扑苹果派</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 颠扑苹果派</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Floating Apple Pie</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shezhengjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shezhengjie\"><img alt=\"shezhengjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/600px-Cg-shezhengjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/900px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/1200px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>好的，牙刷……嗯，红色的这个更好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>临街房屋的花圃里，边境牧羊犬努力地抬着脖子，试图看清屋内正在收拾行李箱的男人。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窗户的高度并不友好，它仅能窥探到室内的一小部分。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>破旧的皮质行李包像是呕吐过一般大张着嘴，歪歪扭扭地横躺在那些花色复杂的衣服中央。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪……呜汪汪。<i>&lt;<i>我想我躲到这里的决定是正确的……这些抉择的难题显然让他的条理性更差了。</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪。<i>&lt;<i>但他衣服的颜色明明如此贫瘠。</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……汪汪，吽吽吽。<i>&lt;<i>不……这也有可能是我身为犬类的局限性，正所谓我不可知本我以外的他者视觉。</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……<i>&lt;<i>但目前这些都不重要……</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯试图将前爪搭上窗框。视野有限地开阔了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毫不意外，屋子里的其他部分和那张床一样凌乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜，汪汪汪……<i>&lt;查尔顿，我想我们需要谈……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>哦！小皮克勒斯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿的脑袋自窗框右侧探了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;<i>噢，你来得正好。</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽吽，吽吽……<i>&lt;<i>实际上，关于法国的演出的事……</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>啊哈，瞧你尾巴摇的！我知道你在担心什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽吽，吽——<i>&lt;<i>那太好了，我——</i>&gt; </i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>锵锵——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>《沉思录》和“皮克勒斯爪爪签名版狗狗足球”——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>选哪个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯尽可能地使自己看起来没那么困惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜呜……<i>&lt;<i>我并不认为这二者之间有选择的必要……</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗难以抉择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>哦，这让我有点意外了……不过——当然可以！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>我们两个都要！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，嗯……<i>&lt;<i>呃，其实……</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿的脑袋收了回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>别担心——自恋倾向是个好兆头！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>“伊丽莎白王后”号的特等船票……哪还会有这样的好机会呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗收回了搭在窗框上的爪子，视野里又只能看到那只老旧的皮质行李包了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……吽吽，吽吽吽。<i>&lt;……我想，沟通对我来说仍是需要多加练习的项目。&gt;</i><br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>花圃的范围有限。牧羊犬缓缓踱步，驻足在了距离门口更近的那侧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shezhengjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shezhengjie\"><img alt=\"shezhengjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/600px-Cg-shezhengjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/900px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/1200px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;<i>好像一切都有所变化。</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>阿嚏——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>早晨的街道静悄悄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺。<i>&lt;<i>但一切又好像没有变化。</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺，狺？<i>&lt;<i>我们的改变如果对现实没有影响，那我们的行为真的具有意义吗？</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>花圃被修剪一新。小狗黑白相间的花纹在草坪上变得明显了许多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺，狺狺。<i>&lt;<i>或许变化还是有的，比如那些被他回绝掉的广告。</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺狺。<i>&lt;<i>但我也为那些刺激舌头的怪味饮料做了违心的推荐。</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺……狺狺？<i>&lt;<i>或许我应该把问题的要点聚焦于别的地方……为什么旅行会让查尔顿如此兴奋呢？</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺。<i>&lt;<i>又或许我确实缺乏除妥协以外的沟通经验。</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗需要的经验还有很多——比如习惯某些安静被打破的瞬间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>汪！！汪汪！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叫声自远处传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪？<i>&lt;<i>是温迪？</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪？嗯……<i>&lt;<i>香气？唔……</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜……汪汪汪。<i>&lt;<i>确实……有很香甜的味道。</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺，狺。<i>&lt;<i>可是今天查尔顿忙着收拾行李，并没有做苹果派。</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺……？<i>&lt;<i>那么是哪来的……？</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某今天的运动量超过了规定范围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪？！<i>&lt;<i>苹果先生？！</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>香甜的红色圆球晃悠悠地自眼前飘过，速度喜人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而紧随其后的小斗牛犬则开足了马力，它甚至没注意到后爪上还挂着条不知从何而来的波西米亚风丝巾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽，吽吽！<i>&lt;<i>温迪，快停下！</i>&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这对温迪来说太难了——可以自主移动的，富有美妙香气的圆形果实，还有什么比这更符合它的心意呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>獒獒，獒獒。<i>&lt;<i>噢，这下麻烦了。</i>&gt;</i></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "小狗与流浪汉-02"}}